  "spec_section": "protocol.md §9.21 + §3.4 + §5.2 + §6.4",
  "description": "Pins protocol::encode_themes_blob_raw + protocol::decode_themes_blob byte mapping for the MYT1 vault.themes encrypted custom-themes codec (MYND-486; §9.21). A near-clone of vault-dictionary: the inner plaintext is OPAQUE (the client layer's deterministic JSON {theme_name -> palette_map} map) — the structural twin of vault.dictionary/vault.search/vault.workspace/vault.indices. custom_themes_key = derive_subkey(root_key, SubkeyRole::CustomThemesKey) (HKDF role 'custom-themes-key'); account_number_hash binds via aad_custom_themes_blob (AAD role 'custom-themes-blob' — a DISTINCT load-bearing string from the HKDF role). 12 cases: 3 encrypt (empty / small map / 1-KB) + 1 decrypt_ok + 2 decrypt_aead_fail (tag-tamper + cross-vault, both non-distinguishing per §6.4, real-key fixtures) + 6 parse_fail (one per distinguishable pre-decryption structural reject incl. the load-bearing format_unsupported forward hook, §9.21.4). Cases generated by `cargo test -p protocol --lib emit_themes_blob_vectors_for_paste -- --ignored` (in protocol/src/themes_blob.rs).",
